OL,3,AUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent
OL,4,Arelocated after alleged Iranian threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent has
OL,7,Fbeen moved from his Washington DC home
OL,8,Fto a military base after Iran-linked
OL,9,Fthreats to his life, according to US
OL,10,Fmedia reports.
OL,12,FCBS, the BBC's US partner, said the
OL,13,Frelocation came after a photo of
OL,14,FBessent's home was published in the
OL,15,FWall Street Journal.
OL,17,FBessent has been at the forefront of
OL,18,Fefforts to isolate Iran economically
OL,19,Fthrough sanctions and a wider economic
OL,20,Fblockade.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
